# Custom Transform Strategies

Place custom transform strategies here.

Example:
  # strategies/movie_normalizer.py
  from transform.base import BaseStrategy

  class MovieNormalizerStrategy(BaseStrategy):
      def apply(self, data: list[dict]) -> list[dict]:
          # Custom movie normalization
          return normalized_data

Then register in transform/base.py:
  STRATEGIES["movie_normalize"] = MovieNormalizerStrategy
